
## 2. Updated `.gitignore`

Project root mein `.gitignore` file banao:

```gitignore
# =====================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES & SECRETS
# =====================================

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.local

# Private credentials
*client_secret*.json
*service-account*.json
service-account.json
credentials.json

*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# =====================================
# SUPABASE LOCAL FILES
# =====================================

.supabase/
supabase/.temp/
.env.supabase

# IMPORTANT:
# Do not ignore the actual supabase/ folder.
# Keep your migrations and Edge Functions in GitHub.

# =====================================
# DEPENDENCIES
# =====================================

node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.npm/

# =====================================
# BUILD OUTPUT
# =====================================

dist/
build/
out/
.netlify/
.vercel/

# =====================================
# LOGS
# =====================================

*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# =====================================
# TEST & COVERAGE OUTPUT
# =====================================

coverage/
.nyc_output/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# =====================================
# OPERATING SYSTEM FILES
# =====================================

.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# =====================================
# EDITORS
# =====================================

.vscode/
.idea/

# =====================================
# TEMPORARY FILES
# =====================================

*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# =====================================
# LOCAL DATABASE / BACKUP FILES
# =====================================

*.dump
*.backup
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3